<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-divider"><hr class="divider divider--normal divider--align-left"/></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:50px"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Marián Madara" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/marian-madara.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/marian-madara.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/marian-madara.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/marian-madara.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Podiel priameho online predaja neustále zvyšujeme aj vďaka možnostiam dynamickej cenotvorby a prepojenia s CRM, ktoré systém protel umožňuje.
</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Marián Madara <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">TMR Hotels, PMS Master User | Department management </span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Eliška Škubalová" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/eliska-skubalova.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/eliska-skubalova.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/eliska-skubalova.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/eliska-skubalova.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Protel v našem hotelu využíváme již mnoho let a za tu dobu nám byl vždy oporou v každodenním fungování hotelu. Velmi vstřícný support je velkým bonusem. </blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Eliška Škubalová <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">GRAND HOTEL BOHEMIA, Director of Sales</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-9-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Miroslav Bukva" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/miroslav-bukva.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/miroslav-bukva.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Vybrat do hotelu vhodný software není jednoduché, protože různé typy hotelů mají odlišné potřeby. Pro velký hotel s konferenčním centrem je robustní řešení PMS PROTEL naprosto ideální. PROTEL je výborný jak z hlediska výkonu, tak ceny a důležitou samozřejmostí je velmi kvalitní podpora.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Miroslav Bukva <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Aquapalace Hotel Prague, General Manager</span></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:50px"></div></div></div></div>
